[CHANGE] benchmark_1/parts/dag_engine_lite/lib/dag_engine_lite_impl.py: Fix three defects: (1) FAIL_FAST now cancels only PENDING nodes, not READY nodes — READY nodes are eligible for execution per spec dag_engine_lite.pyi line 432. (2) retries_attempted changed from attempt+1 to attempt — attempt is zero-indexed (0,1,2 for max_attempts=3), so retries_attempted correctly equals 2 not 3 per spec line 129. (3) _sync_states() now resets state only when _states is empty (fresh lifecycle after initialize()), removing the stale _current_nodes != node_tuple comparison that was resetting execution state during active DAGRunner runs, breaking is_finished(). Removed unused _current_nodes field.
